# Installers are release assets, never repository files.
#
# GitHub refuses any file over 100 MiB in a repository, and the 0.1.1 installer
# is 100.65 MiB — a push carrying it is rejected outright, not warned about. A
# release asset may be up to 2 GB, which is where it belongs anyway: this
# repository then stays a few kilobytes however many versions it carries.
#
# Keep a build here if it is convenient to drag from. It will not be committed.
*.exe
*.blockmap
